    {
      "id": "sxNYm8wB3pQ4WDPEXA-7l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1105.4443337809103,
      "y": 20.362668542647242,
      "width": 651.9395141601562,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "B274MhwkxXGVSjCHqcn6m"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 885443870,
      "version": 697,
      "versionNonce": 560164994,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787558156626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify requirements = features, type of objects\n2. Entities , relationships = Tweet, vechicle, Book, Comment, User\n3. Class Design / Draw LLD & Explain\n    - classess with attributes, methods, relations b/w them\n4. Interaction flow = user requests to response\n5. Implementation = OOPs, SOLID, Design patterns\n6. Failure handling/Edge cases = empty, concurrency, race condition\n7. Extensibility = easy add new type/feature\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify requirements = features, type of objects\n2. Entities , relationships = Tweet, vechicle, Book, Comment, User\n3. Class Design / Draw LLD & Explain\n    - classess with attributes, methods, relations b/w them\n4. Interaction flow = user requests to response\n5. Implementation = OOPs, SOLID, Design patterns\n6. Failure handling/Edge cases = empty, concurrency, race condition\n7. Extensibility = easy add new type/feature\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZQlmmQlWDkrK4UNx5SvPA",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -1123.8413444847506,
      "y": -69.2971065207741,
      "width": 709.1488766483701,
      "height": 332.4625227901952,
