    {
      "id": "2bOJ8zuXMxALtjmODpzKm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 563.39227105774,
      "y": 181.5204294300889,
      "width": 651.6596069335938,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2140216322,
      "version": 899,
      "versionNonce": 652186178,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787593170254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Single Floor/level or multi-floor (yes) with certain no.of spots\n    - ParkingSlots - types by size ?\n        - 2-wheelers - small\n        - 4-wheelers - medium\n        - Heavy - truck/bus - large\n    - Vehicle Types (2,4,heavy)\n    - Issue a track ticket with entry time while entering\n    - calculate parking fee on duration on pricing strategy\n        - flat-rate or vehicle type rate\n    - display real-time availability of parking spots\n\n2. Entities:\n    - ParkingLot : will contains the no.of slots\n    - ParkingSpot : size based slot\n    - Vehicle : Bike, Car, Truck\n    - Ticket: \n    - PriceStrategy: flat-rate, vehicle type-rate\n\n3. Class Design:\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Single Floor/level or multi-floor (yes) with certain no.of spots\n    - ParkingSlots - types by size ?\n        - 2-wheelers - small\n        - 4-wheelers - medium\n        - Heavy - truck/bus - large\n    - Vehicle Types (2,4,heavy)\n    - Issue a track ticket with entry time while entering\n    - calculate parking fee on duration on pricing strategy\n        - flat-rate or vehicle type rate\n    - display real-time availability of parking spots\n\n2. Entities:\n    - ParkingLot : will contains the no.of slots\n    - ParkingSpot : size based slot\n    - Vehicle : Bike, Car, Truck\n    - Ticket: \n    - PriceStrategy: flat-rate, vehicle type-rate\n\n3. Class Design:\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
